capability httpResponseWriter http.response write
purpose operation httpResponseWriter "Authority to write auction HTTP response headers and bodies."
capability heapAllocCapability heap allocate
purpose operation heapAllocCapability "Authority to allocate per-request auction JSON scratch buffers."
capability heapFreeCapability heap free
purpose operation heapFreeCapability "Authority to release per-request auction JSON scratch buffers."
capability memoryBufferReadWriteCapability memory.buffer readWrite
purpose operation memoryBufferReadWriteCapability "Authority to read and compare auction command request buffers."
capability jsonDocumentReadCapability json.document.tree read
purpose operation jsonDocumentReadCapability "Authority to read parsed auction command JSON documents."
capability jsonDocumentWriteCapability json.document.tree write
purpose operation jsonDocumentWriteCapability "Authority to serialize auction response JSON documents."
capability jwtTokenSigner jwt.hs256 signVerify
purpose operation jwtTokenSigner "Authority required by auction handlers that call shared bearer-token helpers."
capability sqliteDatabaseReader database read
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReader "Authority to execute auction read-only SQLite statements."
capability sqliteDatabaseReadWriter database readWrite
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReadWriter "Authority to execute auction command SQLite transactions."

